# The private derived corpus, when it is checked out inside this one rather than
# beside it. CI does exactly that (`ci.yml` clones `contra-data` here and points
# `CONTRA_DATA` at it, because `actions/checkout` will not write above the
# workspace), and it must not reach `prettier --check .` or `git status`.
/contra-data/
